# DEV-ONLY BYOK prefill. Copy to ui/.env (gitignored) to skip retyping keys in the UI while
# developing — the Live connection form is prefilled from these on `npm run dev`.
#
# ⚠️  SECURITY: Vite embeds VITE_* vars into the CLIENT bundle at build time. These are read ONLY
# behind `import.meta.env.DEV`, so they are tree-shaken out of production builds, and `ui/.env` is
# gitignored. NEVER put real keys in a build you intend to deploy (they would ship in the public JS).
#
# Direct (CORS-friendly) endpoint, or a deployed "(via proxy)" base — your own key either way.
VITE_BYOK_BASE_URL="https://openrouter.ai/api/v1"
VITE_BYOK_API_KEY=""
VITE_BYOK_MODEL="openai/gpt-4o-mini"
